{"t":13254,"o":"\u001b[?25l\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[6A\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRivers are the planet's oldest roads. Long before\u001b[53Gpeople\u001b[60Gdrew\u001b[65Gmaps,\u001b[71Gwater\u001b[77Gcarved\u001b[84Gpaths\u001b[90Gthrough\u001b[98Grock,\u001b[104Gfollowing\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bslope\u001b[9Gof\u001b[12Gthe\u001b[16Gland\u001b[21Gtoward\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gsea.\u001b[37GEach\u001b[42Gone\u001b[46Gbegins\u001b[53Gas\u001b[56Ga\u001b[58Gtrickle\u001b[66Gfrom\u001b[71Ga\u001b[73Gspring,\u001b[81Ga\u001b[83Gmelting\u001b[91Gglacier,\u001b[100Gor\u001b[103Ga\u001b[105Grain-soaked\r\u001b[1B  hillside, then gathers tributaries until it becomes something that can carry soil, sand, and stone for hundreds or\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  thousands\u001b[13Gof\u001b[16Gkilometers.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BA river is always working, even when\u001b[40Git\u001b[43Glooks\u001b[49Gcalm.\u001b[55GIts\u001b[59Gcurrent\u001b[67Glifts\u001b[73Gfine\u001b[78Gsediment\u001b[87Gand\u001b[91Gdrops\u001b[97Gheavier\u001b[105Ggrains\u001b[112Gwhere it\r\n\u001b[3Gslows,\u001b[10Gslowly\u001b[17Greshaping\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gvalley\u001b[38Garound\u001b[45Git.\u001b[49GOver\u001b[54Gcenturies\u001b[64Git\u001b[67Gcuts\u001b[72Gcanyons,\u001b[81Gbuilds\u001b[88Gfloodplains,\u001b[101Gand\u001b[105Gshifts\u001b[112Gits\r\n\u001b[3Gcourse\u001b[10Gacross\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gland,\u001b[27Gleaving\u001b[35Gbehind\u001b[42Goxbow\u001b[48Glakes\u001b[54Gwhere\u001b[60Gold\u001b[64Gbends\u001b[70Gwere\u001b[75Gabandoned.\u001b[86GThe\u001b[90Glandscape\u001b[100Git\u001b[103Gleaves\u001b[110Gis\u001b[113Gthe\r\n\u001b[3Grecord\u001b[10Gof\u001b[13Gthat\u001b[18Gwork.\r\n\r\n\u001b[3GRivers\u001b[10Ghave\u001b[15Galso\u001b[20Gshaped\u001b[27Ghuman\u001b[33Glife\u001b[38Gmore\u001b[43Gthan\u001b[48Galmost\u001b[55Ganything\u001b[64Gelse.\u001b[70GCities\u001b[77Gwere\u001b[82Gfounded\u001b[90Gon\u001b[93Gtheir\u001b[99Gbanks\u001b[105Gbecause\